-- תקנון שירות עובדי הוראה, פרק 7, §7.6 מנהל
-- The school principal: the work unit; how a principal is selected and
-- appointed (vacancy notices, the advisory and higher committees, acting
-- appointments); the principal's duties in primary and post-primary
-- schools; probation and tenure; the management, telephone and travel
-- allowances; substitution and absence; and seniority in management.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

§ `7.6 מנהל`

@desc The actors section 7.6 names that the takanon's common vocabulary does not.
DECLARE `7.6 party` IS ONE OF
    `a takanon party`                        HAS `who` IS A Party
    `the senior division head`               @desc מנהל האגף הבכיר לכוח אדם בהוראה, or one authorised by him
    `the district personnel head`            @desc מנהל תחום כוח אדם בהוראה במחוז, who coordinates the advisory committee
    `the advisory committee`
    `the advisory committee chair`
    `an advisory committee member`
    `the higher committee`
    `the higher committee chair`
    `the appointments officer`               @desc האחראי על מינוי מנהלים in the senior teaching-personnel division
    `the candidate`
    `the district office`                    @desc הלשכה המחוזית
    `the seminar organisers`

DECLARE `7.6 action` IS ONE OF
    `work overtime above the base`
    `approve overtime`
    `notify the day-off substitute's name`
    `ask for a vacancy notice`
    `publish a vacancy notice`         HAS `channel` IS A `publication channel`
    `submit an application`
    `supply certified copies`
    `declare family relations`
    `invite to an interview`           HAS `days ahead` IS A NUMBER
    `invite a candidate below the threshold`
    `ask a political question`
    `disclose candidates' names before the meeting`
    `take part despite a family relation`
    `let the candidate answer adverse information`
    `record the protocol in Marom`
    `sign the evaluation summary`
    `disclose the committee's deliberations`
    `submit the protocol`
    `decide the appointment`
    `give a reasoned decision`
    `notify the chosen candidate`
    `notify the district manager of the decision`
    `notify the other candidates in writing`
    `forward the protocol to the senior division`
    `propose a new notice or an acting appointment`
    `appoint an acting principal`
    `reason in writing whether to continue an acting appointment`
    `publish a notice for the next year`
    `invite the general supervisor as observer`
    `admit another observer`
    `take information after dispersing`
    `decide at the end of the interviews`
    `deliver the probation lists`
    `forward the probation list to the local authority`
    `submit a detailed evaluation`
    `visit and evaluate in writing`
    `bring the visit forward`
    `send the authority's evaluation`
    `notify deficiencies in writing`
    `forward a termination proposal`
    `forward a tenure proposal`
    `convene a consultation on differing evaluations`
    `sign the tenure or dismissal notice`
    `perform a primary duty`           HAS `primary duty done` IS A `primary principal's duty`
    `perform a post-primary duty`      HAS `post-primary duty done` IS A `post-primary principal's duty`
    `remark to a teacher before pupils or parents`
    `hand a teacher a letter of recommendation`
    `obtain the other principal's consent`
    `assign a special task to a teacher of another school`
    `take additional work in school hours`
    `take a paid role in the school`
    `visit the lessons of teachers without tenure`
    `talk with the teacher about the visit`
    `report on the state of the school`
    `attend a seminar in working hours` HAS `seminar days this month` IS A NUMBER
    `plan the seminars for afternoons or vacations`
    `submit the telephone request to` HAS `addressee` IS A Party

-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6/p2 Table-of-contents line (7.6.1); the subsection is encoded below.
-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6/p3 Table-of-contents line (7.6.2); the subsection is encoded below.
-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6/p4 Table-of-contents line (7.6.3); the subsection is encoded below.
-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6/p5 Table-of-contents line (7.6.4); the subsection is encoded below.
-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6/p6 Table-of-contents line (7.6.6); the subsection is encoded below.
-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6/p7 Table-of-contents line (7.6.8); the subsection is encoded below.
-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6/p8 Table-of-contents line (7.6.9); the subsection is encoded below.
-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6/p9 Table-of-contents line (7.6.10); the subsection is encoded below.

§§ `7.6.1 יחידת עבודה`

-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6/p10 Heading of section 7.6.1 ("יחידת עבודה").

@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6/p11
GIVEN `base for the educational layer` IS A NUMBER @desc the weekly base position of the layer the principal is employed in, management and teaching hours included; set outside this section, so an input
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `principal's base position` `base for the educational layer` IS
    `base for the educational layer`

DECLARE `kind of institution headed` IS ONE OF
    `a school`
    `a teacher-training college`

-- 6 weekly teaching hours; 2 in a teacher-training college. Sections
-- 7.6.3.1(3)(d) and 7.6.3.2(19)(c) restate the 6 hours, "unless released
-- for special reasons for a period": the release is read in here.
@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6/p12
GIVEN k IS A `kind of institution headed`, `released for special reasons` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `principal's minimum teaching hours` k `released for special reasons` IS
    IF `released for special reasons`
    THEN 0
    ELSE CONSIDER k
         WHEN `a school`                   THEN 6
         WHEN `a teacher-training college` THEN 2

-- Overtime above the base needs a request and the district office's
-- approval first. Time in school months.
@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6/p13
GIVETH A DEONTIC `7.6 party` `7.6 action`
DECIDE `a principal's overtime needs approval` IS
    PARTY `the district office`
    MAY   `approve overtime`
    WITHIN 1
    HENCE (PARTY `a takanon party` `the school principal` MAY `work overtime above the base`)
    LEST  (PARTY `a takanon party` `the school principal`
           SHANT `work overtime above the base`
           LEST BREACH BY `a takanon party` `the school principal` BECAUSE "section 7.6.1.3: overtime above the base needs the district office's approval")

-- Principals work five days a week. On the day the principal is away the
-- deputy stands in, or — where there is no deputy — an educator who
-- receives another role allowance, combining the two roles on Friday
-- without extra pay. Restated in section 7.6.9.1.
@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6/p14 akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_9/p1
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `principal's working days a week` IS 5

DECLARE `day-off substitute` IS ONE OF
    `the deputy`
    `an educator receiving another role allowance`

@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6/p14 akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_9/p1
GIVEN `the school has a deputy` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `day-off substitute`
DECIDE `who stands in on the principal's day off` `the school has a deputy` IS
    IF `the school has a deputy` THEN `the deputy` ELSE `an educator receiving another role allowance`

@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6/p14
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `extra pay for combining the roles on Friday` IS 0

@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6/p15 akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_9/p2
GIVETH A DEONTIC `7.6 party` `7.6 action`
DECIDE `the principal names the day-off substitute` IS
    PARTY `a takanon party` `the school principal`
    MUST  `notify the day-off substitute's name`
    WITHIN 1
    LEST  BREACH BY `a takanon party` `the school principal` BECAUSE "section 7.6.1.4: the principal notifies the substitute's name to the supervisor, the local authority, the teachers and the parents"

@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6/p15
`who is told the substitute's name` MEANS
    LIST "the supervisor", "the local authority", "the teachers", "the parents"

-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6/p16 A pointer to section 1.24 (overtime in management), encoded there.
-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6/p17 Effective date of section 7.6.1 (from 1.9.82); the file encodes the rules in force and carries no dates.
-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6/p18 A pointer to section 7.3.1 for principals aged 50 or more at the reform, encoded there.
-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6/p19 Heading of the source list (אסמכתא).
-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6/p20 Source: a director-general's circular.
-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6/p21 Source: a special director-general's circular.

§§ `7.6.2 מינוי מנהלים במוסדות חינוך רשמיים`

-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6/p22 Heading of section 7.6.2.
-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6/p23 A pointer to "the updated director-general's circular on the subject", a document outside the takanon.
-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6/p24 Heading ("מבוא").
-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6/p25 Heading ("תמצית").

-- The summary: a principal is chosen by an advisory committee of the
-- ministry, the local authority and the teachers' organisations, whose
-- decision is a recommendation only; the director-general decides.
@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6/p26
GIVETH A Party
DECIDE `who decides a principal's appointment` IS `the director-general`

@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6/p26
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the advisory committee's decision binds` IS FALSE

-- Deputies are chosen by an advisory committee of the principal (in a
-- six-year school, the middle school's principal) and the supervisor; it
-- recommends, and the district manager decides.
@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6/p27
GIVETH A Party
DECIDE `who decides a deputy's appointment` IS `the district manager`

@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6/p27
GIVEN `a six-year school` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A STRING
DECIDE `the principal on the deputies' committee` `a six-year school` IS
    IF `a six-year school` THEN "the middle school's principal" ELSE "the school's principal"

-- The threshold conditions also bind candidates to manage recognised
-- schools that are not official.
@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6/p27
DECLARE `kind of school` IS ONE OF
    `official school`
    `recognised non-official school`

@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6/p27
GIVEN k IS A `kind of school`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the threshold conditions apply` k IF TRUE

-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6/p28 Effective date of the procedure (from 2.3.2021); the file encodes the rules in force and carries no dates.
-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6/p29 Heading of the source list (אסמכתא).
-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6/p30 Source: a director-general's circular.
-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6/p31 Heading of section 7.6.2.1 ("פרסום הודעה על משרה פנויה").
-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6/p32 Heading ("פרסום הודעה על משרה פנויה").
-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6/p33 Heading ("הדרך לפרסום הודעה").

§§§ `7.6.2.1 פרסום הודעה על משרה פנויה`

-- A district manager who wants to fill a principal's post that is vacant,
-- or about to be, must ask the senior division head to publish a notice.
@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6/p34
GIVEN `wants to fill the post` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC `7.6 party` `7.6 action`
DECIDE `the district manager asks for a notice` `wants to fill the post` IS
    IF `wants to fill the post`
    THEN PARTY `a takanon party` `the district manager`
         MUST  `ask for a vacancy notice`
         WITHIN 1
         HENCE `the senior division head publishes the notice`
         LEST  BREACH BY `a takanon party` `the district manager` BECAUSE "section 7.6.2.1(1.1)(a): the district manager asks the senior division head to publish"
    ELSE FULFILLED

@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6/p35
DECLARE `publication channel` IS ONE OF
    @ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6/p36
    `the national press`
    @ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6/p37
    `the ministry's website`

@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6/p35
GIVETH A DEONTIC `7.6 party` `7.6 action`
DECIDE `the senior division head publishes the notice` IS
    PARTY `the senior division head`
    MUST  `publish a vacancy notice` c
    WITHIN 1
    LEST  BREACH BY `the senior division head` BECAUSE "section 7.6.2.1(1.1)(b): the notice is published in at least one of the ways listed"

-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6/p38 Heading ("פרטי ההודעה").

@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6/p39
DECLARE `what the notice points to` IS ONE OF
    `the vacancies' details`
    `the qualifications needed: personal data and special requirements`
    `the last day for applying`
    `a link for applying online`

@desc A candidate's application, as section 7.6.2 handles it.
DECLARE `application` HAS
    `meets every threshold condition`   IS A BOOLEAN @desc the threshold conditions of the post "as detailed in Annex 1" (F-7.6-b); an input
    `contact details complete and current` IS A BOOLEAN
    `submitted by the deadline`          IS A BOOLEAN
    `submitted through the online form`  IS A BOOLEAN
    `state-religious post`               IS A BOOLEAN
    `approved by the state-religious education council` IS A BOOLEAN
    `other material reason not to invite` IS A BOOLEAN @desc a material reason the district has not to invite the candidate

@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6/p40 akn:chp_7__sec_7_6/p42 akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_2_1
GIVEN a IS AN `application`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the application is received` a IF
        a's `meets every threshold condition`
    AND a's `submitted by the deadline`
    AND a's `submitted through the online form`

@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6/p41
GIVEN a IS AN `application`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the application is handled` a IF
    `the application is received` a AND a's `contact details complete and current`

-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6/p43 Heading of the source list (אסמכתא).
-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6/p44 Source: a director-general's circular.
-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6/p45 Heading of section 7.6.2.2 ("הגשת בקשות למשרה פנויה").

§§§ `7.6.2.2 הגשת בקשות למשרה פנויה`

@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_2_2
GIVEN `the district asked for copies` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC `7.6 party` `7.6 action`
DECIDE `the candidate supplies certified copies` `the district asked for copies` IS
    IF `the district asked for copies`
    THEN PARTY `the candidate`
         MUST  `supply certified copies`
         WITHIN 1
         LEST  BREACH BY `the candidate` BECAUSE "section 7.6.2.2(1.2.2): certified copies of certificates and documents, on demand"
    ELSE FULFILLED

@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_2_3
GIVETH A LIST OF STRING
DECIDE `who checks the candidate's details on submission` IS
    LIST "the ministry's security officer", "the discipline division"

-- The candidate declares, on the form, any family relation and its degree
-- with the institution's staff, the local authority's employees and the
-- ministry's employees.
@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_2_4
DECLARE `relation to declare` IS ONE OF
    `with the institution's teaching or administrative staff`
    `with the local authority's employees`
    `with the ministry's employees`

@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_2_4
GIVETH A DEONTIC `7.6 party` `7.6 action`
DECIDE `the candidate declares family relations` IS
    PARTY `the candidate`
    MUST  `declare family relations`
    WITHIN 1
    LEST  BREACH BY `the candidate` BECAUSE "section 7.6.2.2(1.2.4): family relations and their degree are declared on the form"

-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_2_4/p2 Heading of the source list (אסמכתא).
-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_2_4/p3 Source: a director-general's circular.
-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_2_4/p4 Heading of section 7.6.2.3 ("ועדת היועצים").

§§§ `7.6.2.3 ועדת היועצים`

-- The invitation goes by e-mail at least two days before the interview.
-- Time in days.
@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_3_1__para_a
GIVETH A DEONTIC `7.6 party` `7.6 action`
DECIDE `the interview invitation` IS
    PARTY `the district personnel head`
    MUST  `invite to an interview` d PROVIDED d AT LEAST 2
    WITHIN 1
    LEST  BREACH BY `the district personnel head` BECAUSE "section 7.6.2.3(1.3.1)(a): the invitation is sent at least two days before the interview"

@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_3_1__para_b__subpara_1 akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_3_1__para_b__subpara_2
GIVEN a IS AN `application`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the candidate is invited to an interview` a IF
        a's `meets every threshold condition`
    AND NOT a's `other material reason not to invite`
    AND ((NOT a's `state-religious post`) OR a's `approved by the state-religious education council`)

-- With no candidate meeting the published requirements, further notices
-- are published as far as possible; if still none, the most suitable
-- candidate is appointed acting for one school year (sections 1.5.2-1.5.3).
DECLARE `step when no candidate qualifies` IS ONE OF
    `publish further notices`
    `appoint the most suitable candidate acting for one year`

@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_3_1__para_b__subpara_3
GIVEN `further notices already published` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `step when no candidate qualifies`
DECIDE `what follows when no candidate qualifies` `further notices already published` IS
    IF `further notices already published`
    THEN `appoint the most suitable candidate acting for one year`
    ELSE `publish further notices`

@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_3_1__para_c
GIVEN a IS AN `application`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the candidate can see the reason online` a IF
    NOT a's `meets every threshold condition`

-- (a): suitability is examined in personality and qualifications; a
-- candidate who does not meet every condition the notice called necessary
-- is not found qualified (subject to 1.3.1(b)).
@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_3_2__para_a
GIVEN a IS AN `application`, `suitable in personality and qualifications` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may be found qualified` a `suitable in personality and qualifications` IF
    a's `meets every threshold condition` AND `suitable in personality and qualifications`

-- (b): the candidates are interviewed orally by the members the district
-- personnel head (the committee's coordinator) invites, in these
-- compositions. Each composition has one local-authority representative
-- only, as the text stresses each time.
DECLARE `committee seat` IS ONE OF
    `the district manager or representative, as chair`
    `the head of religious education or representative, as chair`
    `the district manager or representative`
    `a representative of the teachers' union centre`
    `a representative of the post-primary teachers' organisation`
    `one local-authority representative` @desc the local education authority's head or education department head (for a primary school also the primary-schools department head; for a middle school also the post-primary department head; in a youth village not under a local authority, the village's head or owner's representative instead)
    `a ministry representative from headquarters or another district` @desc or, failing that, from the committee's own district
    `the special-education supervisor`
    `the professional-development division head or representative`
    `the special-education division head or representative`
    `a representative of the gifted and excelling pupils division`
    `the contents, training and in-service division head or representative, as chair`
    `a national supervisor of the society and youth administration`
    `a district representative of the society and youth administration`
    `the adult-education division head or representative, as chair`
    `the district adult-education supervisor`
    `a district science supervisor`

DECLARE `institution to be headed` IS ONE OF
    `primary, state`, `primary, state-religious`,
    `middle school, state`, `middle school, state-religious`,
    `special-education school`, `PISGA centre`, `MATYA centre`, `gifted pupils' centre`,
    `national guidance centre`, `district guidance centre`, `ulpan`, `science centre`

@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_3_2__para_b__subpara_1__cls_a
`primary state committee` MEANS
    LIST `the district manager or representative, as chair`, `a representative of the teachers' union centre`,
         `one local-authority representative`, `a ministry representative from headquarters or another district`
@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_3_2__para_b__subpara_1__cls_b
`primary state-religious committee` MEANS
    LIST `the head of religious education or representative, as chair`, `the district manager or representative`,
         `a representative of the teachers' union centre`, `one local-authority representative`
@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_3_2__para_b__subpara_2__cls_a
`middle-school state committee` MEANS
    LIST `the district manager or representative, as chair`, `a representative of the teachers' union centre`,
         `a representative of the post-primary teachers' organisation`, `one local-authority representative`,
         `a ministry representative from headquarters or another district`
@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_3_2__para_b__subpara_2__cls_b
`middle-school state-religious committee` MEANS
    LIST `the head of religious education or representative, as chair`, `the district manager or representative`,
         `a representative of the teachers' union centre`, `a representative of the post-primary teachers' organisation`,
         `one local-authority representative`
@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_3_2__para_b__subpara_3
`special-education committee` MEANS
    LIST `the district manager or representative, as chair`, `the special-education supervisor`,
         `a representative of the teachers' union centre`, `a representative of the post-primary teachers' organisation`,
         `one local-authority representative`
@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_3_2__para_b__subpara_4
`PISGA committee` MEANS
    LIST `the district manager or representative, as chair`, `the professional-development division head or representative`,
         `a representative of the teachers' union centre`, `a representative of the post-primary teachers' organisation`,
         `one local-authority representative`
@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_3_2__para_b__subpara_5
`MATYA committee` MEANS
    LIST `the district manager or representative, as chair`, `the special-education division head or representative`,
         `a representative of the teachers' union centre`, `a representative of the post-primary teachers' organisation`,
         `one local-authority representative`
@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_3_2__para_b__subpara_6
`gifted centre committee` MEANS
    LIST `the district manager or representative, as chair`, `a representative of the gifted and excelling pupils division`,
         `a representative of the teachers' union centre`, `a representative of the post-primary teachers' organisation`,
         `one local-authority representative`
@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_3_2__para_b__subpara_7__cls_a
`national guidance centre committee` MEANS
    LIST `the contents, training and in-service division head or representative, as chair`, `a national supervisor of the society and youth administration`,
         `a district representative of the society and youth administration`, `a representative of the post-primary teachers' organisation`,
         `a representative of the teachers' union centre`
@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_3_2__para_b__subpara_7__cls_b
`district guidance centre committee` MEANS
    LIST `the contents, training and in-service division head or representative, as chair`, `the district manager or representative`,
         `a district representative of the society and youth administration`, `a representative of the post-primary teachers' organisation`,
         `a representative of the teachers' union centre`
@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_3_2__para_b__subpara_8
`ulpan committee` MEANS
    LIST `the adult-education division head or representative, as chair`, `the district adult-education supervisor`,
         `one local-authority representative`, `a representative of the post-primary teachers' organisation`,
         `a representative of the teachers' union centre`
@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_3_2__para_b__subpara_9
`science centre committee` MEANS
    LIST `the district manager or representative, as chair`, `a representative of the post-primary teachers' organisation`,
         `a representative of the teachers' union centre`, `a district science supervisor`,
         `one local-authority representative`

@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_3_2__para_b
GIVEN i IS AN `institution to be headed`
GIVETH A LIST OF `committee seat`
DECIDE `the advisory committee for` i IS
    CONSIDER i
    WHEN `primary, state`                 THEN `primary state committee`
    WHEN `primary, state-religious`       THEN `primary state-religious committee`
    WHEN `middle school, state`           THEN `middle-school state committee`
    WHEN `middle school, state-religious` THEN `middle-school state-religious committee`
    WHEN `special-education school`       THEN `special-education committee`
    WHEN `PISGA centre`                   THEN `PISGA committee`
    WHEN `MATYA centre`                   THEN `MATYA committee`
    WHEN `gifted pupils' centre`          THEN `gifted centre committee`
    WHEN `national guidance centre`       THEN `national guidance centre committee`
    WHEN `district guidance centre`       THEN `district guidance centre committee`
    WHEN `ulpan`                          THEN `ulpan committee`
    WHEN `science centre`                 THEN `science centre committee`

`every institution` MEANS
    LIST `primary, state`, `primary, state-religious`, `middle school, state`, `middle school, state-religious`,
         `special-education school`, `PISGA centre`, `MATYA centre`, `gifted pupils' centre`,
         `national guidance centre`, `district guidance centre`, `ulpan`, `science centre`

GIVEN s IS A `committee seat`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a chair's seat` s IF
       s EQUALS `the district manager or representative, as chair`
    OR s EQUALS `the head of religious education or representative, as chair`
    OR s EQUALS `the contents, training and in-service division head or representative, as chair`
    OR s EQUALS `the adult-education division head or representative, as chair`

-- Every composition has exactly one chair and at most one local-authority
-- representative (none, in the two guidance centres).
#ASSERT all (GIVEN i YIELD count (filter `a chair's seat` (`the advisory committee for` i)) EQUALS 1) `every institution`
#ASSERT all (GIVEN i YIELD count (filter (GIVEN s YIELD s EQUALS `one local-authority representative`) (`the advisory committee for` i)) AT MOST 1) `every institution`

-- (c): on a tie the chair's vote counts twice.
@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_3_2__para_c
GIVEN `votes for` IS A NUMBER, `votes against` IS A NUMBER, `the chair votes for` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the committee resolves in favour` `votes for` `votes against` `the chair votes for` IF
    BRANCH IF `votes for` GREATER THAN `votes against` THEN TRUE
           IF `votes for` LESS THAN `votes against`    THEN FALSE
           OTHERWISE `the chair votes for`

-- (d): the ministry's members may not be employees who gave their opinion,
-- as direct or indirect superiors, on a candidate's form for this post.
@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_3_2__para_d
GIVEN `gave an opinion as a candidate's superior` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may sit as a ministry member` `gave an opinion as a candidate's superior` IF
    NOT `gave an opinion as a candidate's superior`

-- Both sexes are represented; otherwise the district manager's (or his
-- delegate's) approval in advance, and in rare cases approval afterwards.
@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_3_2__para_d/p2
GIVEN `both sexes represented` IS A BOOLEAN, `approved in advance` IS A BOOLEAN, `approved afterwards in a rare case` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the committee may sit, or its decisions stand` `both sexes represented` `approved in advance` `approved afterwards in a rare case` IF
    `both sexes represented` OR `approved in advance` OR `approved afterwards in a rare case`

-- (e): the general supervisor is invited as an observer with an advisory
-- voice and is not a member.
@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_3_2__para_e
GIVETH A DEONTIC `7.6 party` `7.6 action`
DECIDE `the general supervisor observes` IS
    PARTY `the district personnel head`
    MUST  `invite the general supervisor as observer`
    WITHIN 1
    LEST  BREACH BY `the district personnel head` BECAUSE "section 7.6.2.3(1.3.2)(e): the general supervisor is invited as an observer"

DECLARE `possible observer` IS ONE OF
    `the general supervisor`
    `the six-year school's principal`
    `the youth village's head`
    `another observer from a member body`

-- The district personnel head may also invite the six-year school's
-- principal, where the post is its middle school's; in a youth village its
-- head may observe; only one of the two. No further observers from the
-- bodies on the committee.
@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_3_2__para_e/p2 akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_3_2__para_e/p3
GIVEN observers IS A LIST OF `possible observer`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the observers are allowed` observers IF
        count (filter (GIVEN o YIELD o EQUALS `the six-year school's principal` OR o EQUALS `the youth village's head`) observers) AT MOST 1
    AND NOT elem `another observer from a member body` observers

@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_3_2__para_f
GIVETH AN `7.6 party`
DECIDE `who sets the committee's place and time` IS `the district personnel head`

-- (g): the quorum is half the members, the chair among them.
@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_3_2__para_g
GIVEN `members present` IS A NUMBER, `members` IS A NUMBER, `the chair is present` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the committee has a quorum` `members present` `members` `the chair is present` IF
    `members present` AT LEAST `members` DIVIDED BY 2 AND `the chair is present`

-- (h): the committee may interview online a candidate abroad or in Israel
-- if documents let it judge the candidate's qualifications, or one kept
-- away by illness, reserve duty or a reason approved in advance; a failure
-- to appear is no ground to postpone the meeting.
@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_3_2__para_h
GIVEN `documents allow judging the qualifications` IS A BOOLEAN, `kept away by illness, reserve duty or an approved reason` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may be interviewed online` `documents allow judging the qualifications` `kept away by illness, reserve duty or an approved reason` IF
    `documents allow judging the qualifications` OR `kept away by illness, reserve duty or an approved reason`

@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_3_2__para_h
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a candidate's absence postpones the meeting` IS FALSE

-- (i), (j): confidentiality of the names; no political questions.
@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_3_2__para_i
GIVETH A DEONTIC `7.6 party` `7.6 action`
DECIDE `the names stay confidential until the meeting` IS
    PARTY `the district personnel head`
    SHANT `disclose candidates' names before the meeting`
    WITHIN 1
    LEST  BREACH BY `the district personnel head` BECAUSE "section 7.6.2.3(1.3.2)(i): candidates' names are disclosed only at the committee's deliberations, save to the ministry staff checking them"

@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_3_2__para_j
GIVETH A DEONTIC `7.6 party` `7.6 action`
DECIDE `no political questions` IS
    PARTY `an advisory committee member`
    SHANT `ask a political question`
    WITHIN 1
    LEST  BREACH BY `an advisory committee member` BECAUSE "section 7.6.2.3(1.3.2)(j): a candidate is not asked about party affiliation or political views"

-- (ja): what the district personnel head lays before the committee.
@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_3_2__para_ja
DECLARE `material before the committee` IS ONE OF
    `the candidate's personal file, or its relevant scanned parts`
    `the evaluations of the candidate as a teacher`
    `the application form and its annexes`
    `the senior division head's report on opinions and checks`

-- (jb), (if): the senior division head may check candidates' data and take
-- opinions (superiors, police, security bodies, referees), all before the
-- committee meets, and reports the findings where he thinks them material.
@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_3_2__para_jb akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_3_2__para_if
GIVEN `the findings are material in his view` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A LIST OF `material before the committee`
DECIDE `material laid before the committee` `the findings are material in his view` IS
    IF `the findings are material in his view`
    THEN LIST `the candidate's personal file, or its relevant scanned parts`, `the evaluations of the candidate as a teacher`,
              `the application form and its annexes`, `the senior division head's report on opinions and checks`
    ELSE LIST `the candidate's personal file, or its relevant scanned parts`, `the evaluations of the candidate as a teacher`,
              `the application form and its annexes`

-- (jc): further information asked during the meeting is used only if the
-- candidate had a right to answer it; (jg): a member who knows of adverse
-- information tells the candidate and lets him answer.
@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_3_2__para_jc
GIVEN `relevant to the selection` IS A BOOLEAN, `the candidate could answer it` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `further information may be used` `relevant to the selection` `the candidate could answer it` IF
    `relevant to the selection` AND `the candidate could answer it`

@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_3_2__para_jg
GIVEN `holds adverse information` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC `7.6 party` `7.6 action`
DECIDE `adverse information is put to the candidate` `holds adverse information` IS
    IF `holds adverse information`
    THEN PARTY `an advisory committee member`
         MUST  `let the candidate answer adverse information`
         WITHIN 1
         LEST  BREACH BY `an advisory committee member` BECAUSE "section 7.6.2.3(1.3.2)(17): the candidate is told of adverse information and may answer it"
    ELSE FULFILLED

-- (jd): no information after the committee has dispersed; it decides at
-- the end of the interviews.
@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_3_2__para_jd
GIVETH A DEONTIC `7.6 party` `7.6 action`
DECIDE `the committee decides when the interviews end` IS
    (PARTY `the advisory committee`
     MUST  `decide at the end of the interviews`
     WITHIN 1
     LEST  BREACH BY `the advisory committee` BECAUSE "section 7.6.2.3(1.3.2)(14): the committee decides at the end of all the interviews")
    RAND
    (PARTY `the advisory committee`
     SHANT `take information after dispersing`
     WITHIN 12
     LEST  BREACH BY `the advisory committee` BECAUSE "section 7.6.2.3(1.3.2)(14): no information after the committee has dispersed")

-- (ig): a member related to a candidate or to another member takes no part.
@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_3_2__para_ig
GIVEN `related to a candidate or another member` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC `7.6 party` `7.6 action`
DECIDE `a related member stands aside` `related to a candidate or another member` IS
    IF `related to a candidate or another member`
    THEN PARTY `an advisory committee member`
         SHANT `take part despite a family relation`
         WITHIN 12
         LEST  BREACH BY `an advisory committee member` BECAUSE "section 7.6.2.3(1.3.2)(16): a member related to a candidate or another member takes no part"
    ELSE FULFILLED

@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_3_2__para_jh
GIVETH A DEONTIC `7.6 party` `7.6 action`
DECIDE `the coordinator records the protocol` IS
    PARTY `the district personnel head`
    MUST  `record the protocol in Marom`
    WITHIN 1
    LEST  BREACH BY `the district personnel head` BECAUSE "section 7.6.2.3(1.3.2)(18): the protocol is recorded on the Marom form"

§§§ `1.3.3 סיכומי ועדת היועצים`

-- (a): each member weighs education, experience, "the documents submitted
-- (as stated in section 1.3.2י above)" and the impression, and picks the
-- most qualified, optionally a second. F-7.6-a: 1.3.2י is the clause
-- forbidding political questions; the documents are in 1.3.2יא.
@desc A member's evaluation of the candidates.
DECLARE `member's choice` HAS
    `most qualified`            IS A STRING
    `second qualified, if any`  IS A LIST OF STRING

@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_3_3__para_a
GIVEN c IS A `member's choice`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a valid member's choice` c IF
    count (c's `second qualified, if any`) AT MOST 1

DECLARE `clause of 1.3.2` IS ONE OF
    `1.3.2 (d): ministry members and both sexes`
    `1.3.2 (e): the observers`
    `1.3.2 (j): no political questions`
    `1.3.2 (ja): the material laid before the committee`

@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_3_3__para_a
`the clause 1.3.3(a) cites for the documents` MEANS `1.3.2 (j): no political questions`
@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_3_3__para_d
`the clause 1.3.3(d) cites for the observer` MEANS `1.3.2 (d): ministry members and both sexes`

`1.3.3 cites 1.3.2 one letter behind, twice` MEANS
        `the clause 1.3.3(a) cites for the documents` EQUALS `1.3.2 (j): no political questions`
    AND `the clause 1.3.3(d) cites for the observer`  EQUALS `1.3.2 (d): ministry members and both sexes`
#ASSERT `1.3.3 cites 1.3.2 one letter behind, twice`

-- Reading adopted (F-7.6-a): 1.3.3(a) means the material of 1.3.2(ja), and
-- 1.3.3(d) the observer of 1.3.2(e).
DECLARE `present at the meeting` IS ONE OF
    `a member`, `the observer`, `the coordinator`, `the candidate`, `anyone else`

@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_3_3__para_d
GIVEN p IS A `present at the meeting`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may be present at the advisory committee` p IF
    NOT p EQUALS `anyone else`

-- (b): the summary table is an aid only; the reasons for the recommended
-- candidate are recorded apart from the protocol.
@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_3_3__para_b akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_3_3__para_b/p2
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the summary table decides` IS FALSE

@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_3_3__para_c
GIVETH A DEONTIC `7.6 party` `7.6 action`
DECIDE `the members sign the summary` IS
    PARTY `an advisory committee member`
    MUST  `sign the evaluation summary`
    WITHIN 1
    LEST  BREACH BY `an advisory committee member` BECAUSE "section 7.6.2.3(1.3.3)(c): every member signs the summary"

@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_3_3__para_e
GIVEN `the director-general approved` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC `7.6 party` `7.6 action`
DECIDE `the deliberations are confidential` `the director-general approved` IS
    IF `the director-general approved`
    THEN FULFILLED
    ELSE PARTY `an advisory committee member`
         SHANT `disclose the committee's deliberations`
         WITHIN 12
         LEST  BREACH BY `an advisory committee member` BECAUSE "section 7.6.2.3(1.3.3)(e): the deliberations, documents and conclusions are confidential"

@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_3_3__para_f
GIVETH A DEONTIC `7.6 party` `7.6 action`
DECIDE `the protocol goes to the director-general` IS
    PARTY `the district personnel head`
    MUST  `submit the protocol`
    WITHIN 1
    LEST  BREACH BY `the district personnel head` BECAUSE "section 7.6.2.3(1.3.3)(f): the protocol is submitted, through the senior division head, to the director-general"

-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_3_3/p1 Heading of the source list (אסמכתא).
-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_3_3/p2 Source: a director-general's circular.
-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_3_3/p3 Heading of section 7.6.2.4 ("מינוי בעקבות הודעה על משרה פנויה").

§§§ `7.6.2.4 מינוי בעקבות הודעה על משרה פנויה`

@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_4_1
GIVETH A DEONTIC `7.6 party` `7.6 action`
DECIDE `the director-general decides after the protocol` IS
    PARTY `a takanon party` `the director-general`
    MUST  `decide the appointment`
    WITHIN 12
    HENCE `the candidates are told`
    LEST  BREACH BY `a takanon party` `the director-general` BECAUSE "section 7.6.2.4(1.4.1): the director-general decides after reading the committee's protocol"

-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_4_1/p2 The bare number "1.4.2" heading the two rules below.

@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_4_1/p3 akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_4_1/p4
GIVETH A DEONTIC `7.6 party` `7.6 action`
DECIDE `the candidates are told` IS
    (PARTY `a takanon party` `the district manager`
     MUST  `notify the chosen candidate`
     WITHIN 1
     LEST  BREACH BY `a takanon party` `the district manager` BECAUSE "section 7.6.2.4(1.4.2)(a): the chosen candidate is notified")
    RAND
    (PARTY `a takanon party` `the district manager`
     MUST  `notify the other candidates in writing`
     WITHIN 1
     LEST  BREACH BY `a takanon party` `the district manager` BECAUSE "section 7.6.2.4(1.4.2)(b): the others are told in writing")

DECLARE `reason no one was appointed` IS ONE OF
    @ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_4_3__para_a
    `(a) no application by the deadline`
    @ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_4_3__para_b
    `(b) no candidate met the requirements`
    @ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_4_3__para_c
    `(c) the committee found no one qualified`
    @ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_4_3__para_d
    `(d) the director-general appointed none of the qualified`

-- (d)(1)-(2) apply "where (c) and (d) above hold", (d)(3) "where (a)-(d)
-- above hold". The four are alternatives — 1.4.3 opens "for one of these
-- reasons" — so a conjunction can never be met. F-7.6-c. Reading adopted:
-- "and" as "or": (1)-(2) where the reason is (c) or (d), (3) for any reason.
@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_4_3__para_d__subpara_1 akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_4_3__para_d__subpara_2
GIVEN r IS A `reason no one was appointed`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the protocol is forwarded and the candidates told` r IF
    r EQUALS `(c) the committee found no one qualified` OR r EQUALS `(d) the director-general appointed none of the qualified`

GIVEN r IS A `reason no one was appointed`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the protocol is forwarded and the candidates told, read as "(c) and (d)"` r IF
    r EQUALS `(c) the committee found no one qualified` AND r EQUALS `(d) the director-general appointed none of the qualified`

`"(c) and (d)" read as a conjunction is never met` MEANS
    all (GIVEN r YIELD NOT `the protocol is forwarded and the candidates told, read as "(c) and (d)"` r)
        (LIST `(a) no application by the deadline`, `(b) no candidate met the requirements`,
              `(c) the committee found no one qualified`, `(d) the director-general appointed none of the qualified`)
#ASSERT `"(c) and (d)" read as a conjunction is never met`

DECLARE `proposal to the director-general` IS ONE OF
    @ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_4_3__para_d__subpara_3__cls_a
    `publish a new notice`
    @ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_4_3__para_d__subpara_3__cls_b
    `appoint acting the district manager's recommended candidate`

@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_4_3__para_d__subpara_3
GIVEN r IS A `reason no one was appointed`
GIVETH A DEONTIC `7.6 party` `7.6 action`
DECIDE `when no one was appointed` r IS
    IF `the protocol is forwarded and the candidates told` r
    THEN (PARTY `the district personnel head` MUST `forward the protocol to the senior division` WITHIN 1)
         RAND
         (PARTY `the district personnel head` MUST `notify the other candidates in writing` WITHIN 1)
         RAND
         (PARTY `the senior division head` MUST `propose a new notice or an acting appointment` WITHIN 1)
    ELSE PARTY `the senior division head` MUST `propose a new notice or an acting appointment` WITHIN 1

-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_4_3/p1 Heading of the source list (אסמכתא).
-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_4_3/p2 Source: a director-general's circular.
-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_4_3/p3 Heading of section 7.6.2.5 ("מינוי בפועל ומילוי במקום").

§§§ `7.6.2.5 מינוי בפועל ומילוי מקום`

-- A post vacated temporarily during the year: the director-general appoints
-- a substitute for the vacancy, at the latest to 31 August (the twelfth
-- school month); preferably the deputy, a junior manager or a teacher of
-- the school, on the supervisor's recommendation.
@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_5_1
GIVEN `school month the vacancy ends` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the substitute serves to school month` `school month the vacancy ends` IS
    min `school month the vacancy ends` (`month number` August)

@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_5_1
DECLARE `preferred substitute` IS ONE OF
    `the deputy principal`
    `a teacher in a more junior management grade`
    `a teacher of the school`

-- An acting appointment under 1.4.3's alternative (d)(3)(b): one school
-- year only; the district's supervisors recommend; at least two
-- candidates interviewed where possible; a continuing acting principal's
-- case is weighed and reasoned in writing; preference to one meeting the
-- threshold.
@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_5_2
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `school years an acting appointment lasts` IS 1

@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_5_2
GIVEN `the acting principal continues` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC `7.6 party` `7.6 action`
DECIDE `a continuing acting appointment is reasoned` `the acting principal continues` IS
    IF `the acting principal continues`
    THEN PARTY `a takanon party` `the district manager`
         MUST  `reason in writing whether to continue an acting appointment`
         WITHIN 1
         LEST  BREACH BY `a takanon party` `the district manager` BECAUSE "section 7.6.2.5(1.5.2): the district reasons its decision in writing"
    ELSE FULFILLED

@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_5_2
GIVEN `candidates interviewed` IS A NUMBER, `two were possible` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `enough candidates were interviewed` `candidates interviewed` `two were possible` IF
    `candidates interviewed` AT LEAST 2 OR NOT `two were possible`

@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_5_2/p2
DECLARE `acting-appointment proposal contents` IS ONE OF
    `the proposal`, `the interview protocol`, `the district manager's recommendation`

@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_5_2/p3
GIVEN `the director-general approved` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC `7.6 party` `7.6 action`
DECIDE `the approved acting candidate applies online` `the director-general approved` IS
    IF `the director-general approved`
    THEN PARTY `the candidate` MUST `submit an application` WITHIN 1
    ELSE FULFILLED

@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_5_2/p4
GIVETH A DEONTIC `7.6 party` `7.6 action`
DECIDE `the post is advertised for the next year` IS
    PARTY `the senior division head`
    MUST  `publish a notice for the next year` 
    WITHIN 12

-- No duty to publish for appointments under 1.5.1-1.5.2; the district
-- manager proposes the candidate on the Marom form. In exceptional cases,
-- for special reasons recorded, the director-general may appoint acting
-- even outside 1.5.1-1.5.3.
@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_5_3
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an acting or substitute appointment must be advertised` IS FALSE

@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_5_4
GIVEN `under 1.5.1 to 1.5.3` IS A BOOLEAN, `exceptional case with recorded reasons` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the director-general may appoint acting` `under 1.5.1 to 1.5.3` `exceptional case with recorded reasons` IF
    `under 1.5.1 to 1.5.3` OR `exceptional case with recorded reasons`

-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_5_4/p2 Heading of the source list (אסמכתא).
-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_5_4/p3 Source: a director-general's circular.
-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_5_4/p4 Heading of section 7.6.2.6 ("ועדת יועצים עליונה").

§§§ `7.6.2.6 ועדת יועצים עליונה`

DECLARE `who the higher committee re-examines` IS ONE OF
    `all the candidates who appeared`
    `only the recommended candidates`

@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_6_1__para_a akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_6_2__para_a
GIVEN w IS A `who the higher committee re-examines`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the director-general may convene a higher committee for` w IF TRUE

-- (b): the decision to convene is reasoned, especially against a unanimous
-- or majority recommendation; and the director-general may interview the
-- candidates himself instead.
@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_6_1__para_b
GIVETH A DEONTIC `7.6 party` `7.6 action`
DECIDE `convening the higher committee is reasoned` IS
    PARTY `a takanon party` `the director-general`
    MUST  `give a reasoned decision`
    WITHIN 1
    LEST  BREACH BY `a takanon party` `the director-general` BECAUSE "section 7.6.2.6(1.6.1)(b): the decision to convene a higher committee is reasoned"

DECLARE `re-examination by` IS ONE OF
    `a higher committee`
    `the director-general in person`

@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_6_1__para_b/p2
GIVEN r IS A `re-examination by`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a permitted re-examination` r IF TRUE

@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_6_2__para_b
GIVETH A DEONTIC `7.6 party` `7.6 action`
DECIDE `the higher committee's invitation` IS
    PARTY `the senior division head`
    MUST  `invite to an interview` d PROVIDED d GREATER THAN 0
    WITHIN 1
    LEST  BREACH BY `the senior division head` BECAUSE "section 7.6.2.6(1.6.2)(b): the invitation is sent by e-mail before the interview"

DECLARE `higher committee seat` IS ONE OF
    @ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_6_3__para_b/p2
    `the senior division head, as chair`
    @ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_6_3__para_b/p3
    `the heads of the relevant age divisions, or their delegates`
    @ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_6_3__para_b/p4
    `a representative of the legal bureau`
    @ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_6_3__para_b/p5
    `the appointments officer, as coordinator`

@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_6_3__para_a akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_6_3__para_b
`the higher committee's members` MEANS
    LIST `the senior division head, as chair`, `the heads of the relevant age divisions, or their delegates`,
         `a representative of the legal bureau`, `the appointments officer, as coordinator`

@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_6_3__para_b/p6
GIVEN `a member is absent` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the director-general may name an ad hoc substitute` `a member is absent` IF
    `a member is absent`

@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_6_3__para_c
GIVETH AN `7.6 party`
DECIDE `who sets the higher committee's place and time` IS `the senior division head`

@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_6_3__para_d
GIVEN `abroad and the documents suffice` IS A BOOLEAN, `kept away by illness, reserve duty or an approved reason` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the higher committee may interview online` `abroad and the documents suffice` `kept away by illness, reserve duty or an approved reason` IF
    `abroad and the documents suffice` OR `kept away by illness, reserve duty or an approved reason`

@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_6_3__para_e akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_6_3__para_e/p2 akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_6_3__para_f
GIVEN `the results are relevant in his view` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A LIST OF `material before the committee`
DECIDE `material laid before the higher committee` `the results are relevant in his view` IS
    `material laid before the committee` `the results are relevant in his view`

@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_6_3__para_g
GIVEN `related to a candidate` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC `7.6 party` `7.6 action`
DECIDE `a related higher-committee member stands aside` `related to a candidate` IS
    IF `related to a candidate`
    THEN PARTY `the higher committee`
         SHANT `take part despite a family relation`
         WITHIN 12
         LEST  BREACH BY `the higher committee` BECAUSE "section 7.6.2.6(1.6.3)(g): a member related to a candidate tells the chair and takes no part"
    ELSE FULFILLED

@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_6_3__para_h akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_6_3__para_i akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_6_3__para_j
GIVETH A DEONTIC `7.6 party` `7.6 action`
DECIDE `the higher committee evaluates and signs` IS
    PARTY `the higher committee`
    MUST  `sign the evaluation summary`
    WITHIN 1
    LEST  BREACH BY `the higher committee` BECAUSE "section 7.6.2.6(1.6.3)(h)-(j): each member evaluates in the protocol, the table is an aid only, and all sign"

@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_6_3__para_ja
GIVEN p IS A `present at the meeting`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may be present at the higher committee` p IF
    p EQUALS `a member`

@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_6_3__para_jb
GIVEN `the director-general approved` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC `7.6 party` `7.6 action`
DECIDE `the higher committee is confidential` `the director-general approved` IS
    IF `the director-general approved`
    THEN FULFILLED
    ELSE PARTY `the higher committee`
         SHANT `disclose the committee's deliberations`
         WITHIN 12
         LEST  BREACH BY `the higher committee` BECAUSE "section 7.6.2.6(1.6.3)(12): the deliberations are confidential"

@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_6_3__para_jc
GIVETH A DEONTIC `7.6 party` `7.6 action`
DECIDE `the higher committee's protocol goes to the director-general` IS
    PARTY `the appointments officer`
    MUST  `submit the protocol`
    WITHIN 1
    LEST  BREACH BY `the appointments officer` BECAUSE "section 7.6.2.6(1.6.3)(13): the protocol goes to the director-general through the chair"

@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_6_4__para_a akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_6_4__para_b
GIVETH A DEONTIC `7.6 party` `7.6 action`
DECIDE `the director-general decides after the higher committee` IS
    PARTY `a takanon party` `the director-general`
    MUST  `give a reasoned decision`
    WITHIN 12
    HENCE `the candidates are told after the higher committee`
    LEST  BREACH BY `a takanon party` `the director-general` BECAUSE "section 7.6.2.6(1.6.4)(b): a reasoned decision based on facts, findings and discretion"

@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_6_4__para_c
GIVETH A DEONTIC `7.6 party` `7.6 action`
DECIDE `the candidates are told after the higher committee` IS
    PARTY `the appointments officer`
    MUST  `notify the district manager of the decision`
    WITHIN 1
    HENCE `the candidates are told`

-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_6_4/p1 Heading of the source list (אסמכתא).
-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_1_6_4/p2 Source: a director-general's circular.

§§§ `7.6.2.7-7.6.2.10 התנאים והנספחים`

-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_2_7/p1 Amendment note ("updated 24.6.2012").
-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_2_7/p2 Title of the threshold qualifications for a management post; their content is not in the text this file encodes, so they are the input `meets every threshold condition`.
-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_2_7/p3 Heading of the source list (אסמכתא).
-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_2_7/p4 Source: a director-general's circular.
-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_2_8/p1 Amendment note ("updated 01.09.2011").
-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_2_8/p3 Heading of the source list (אסמכתא).
-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_2_8/p4 Source: a director-general's circular.
-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_2_8/p6 Amendment note ("updated 01.09.2011").
-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_2_8/p8 Heading of the source list (אסמכתא).
-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_2_8/p9 Source: a director-general's circular.
-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_2_9/p1 Amendment note ("updated 01.09.2011").
-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_2_9/p3 Heading of the source list (אסמכתא).
-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_2_9/p4 Source: a director-general's circular.
-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_2_10/p1 Amendment note ("updated 01.09.2011").
-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_2_10/p3 Heading of the source list (אסמכתא).
-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_2_10/p4 Source: a director-general's circular.

-- The annexes as the takanon numbers them. F-7.6-b: the procedure sends
-- the threshold conditions to "Annex 1" (1.1.2(b), 1.3.1(b)(1), 1.5.2),
-- and the takanon's Annex 1 is the request to publish a vacancy notice.
DECLARE `annex content` IS ONE OF
    `the request to publish a vacancy notice`
    `an application for a school management post`
    `the advisory committee's protocol`
    `a proposal for an acting appointment`
    `the threshold conditions`

DECLARE `numbered annex` HAS
    `annex number`  IS A NUMBER
    `annex holds`   IS AN `annex content`

@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_2_8/p2
`annex 1 as printed` MEANS `numbered annex` 1 `the request to publish a vacancy notice`
@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_2_8/p5 akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_2_8/p7
`annex 2 as printed` MEANS `numbered annex` 2 `an application for a school management post`
@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_2_9/p2
`annex 4 as printed` MEANS `numbered annex` 4 `the advisory committee's protocol`
@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_2_10/p2
`annex 5 as printed` MEANS `numbered annex` 5 `a proposal for an acting appointment`

`the takanon's annexes` MEANS LIST `annex 1 as printed`, `annex 2 as printed`, `annex 4 as printed`, `annex 5 as printed`

`the annex the procedure calls 1 does not hold the threshold conditions` MEANS
    all (GIVEN a YIELD a's `annex number` EQUALS 1 IMPLIES NOT a's `annex holds` EQUALS `the threshold conditions`)
        `the takanon's annexes`
    AND NOT any (GIVEN a YIELD a's `annex holds` EQUALS `the threshold conditions`) `the takanon's annexes`
#ASSERT `the annex the procedure calls 1 does not hold the threshold conditions`

§§ `7.6.3 הגדרת תפקידים`

§§§ `7.6.3.1 מנהל בית-ספר יסודי`

DECLARE `primary principal's duty` IS ONE OF
    @ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_1__para_1__subpara_a
    `plan and run teaching, education, administration and order`
    @ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_1__para_1__subpara_b
    `follow the ministry's instructions and make them known to staff and pupils`
    @ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_1__para_2__subpara_a
    `enforce pupils' safety instructions through road-safety, safety and health education`
    @ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_1__para_2__subpara_b
    `plan teachers' supervision at the start of day, breaks, the end of day and activities`
    @ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_1__para_2__subpara_c
    `prepare a proper timetable and a framework for teachers' absences`
    @ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_1__para_2__subpara_d
    `propose to the owners the hiring or dismissal of administrative and maintenance staff`
    @ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_1__para_3__subpara_a
    `give most of the time to pedagogical work`
    @ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_1__para_3__subpara_b
    `plan pedagogical work yearly and by trimester`
    @ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_1__para_3__subpara_c
    `visit teachers' lessons`
    @ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_1__para_4 akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_1__para_4__subpara_a
    `direct and guide teachers in the curriculum`
    @ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_1__para_4__subpara_b
    `introduce new or changed curricula with the supervisor's approval`
    @ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_1__para_4__subpara_c
    `follow pupils' achievements`
    @ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_1__para_4__subpara_d
    `check teachers' work plans and their execution`
    @ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_1__para_4__subpara_e
    `handle parents' requests for supplementary programmes`
    @ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_1__para_5 akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_1__para_5__subpara_a
    `foster national, civic and community education, and religious education in a state-religious school`
    @ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_1__para_5__subpara_b
    `coordinate care for the individual pupil`
    @ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_1__para_5__subpara_c
    `foster school life, and prayer and observance in a state-religious school`
    @ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_1__para_5__subpara_d
    `foster social education`
    @ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_1__para_5__subpara_e
    `hold parties, celebrations and trips`
    @ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_1__para_5__subpara_f
    `keep ties with recognised youth movements`
    @ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_1__para_5__subpara_g
    `keep ties with those in charge of supplementary education`
    @ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_1__para_6 akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_1__para_6__subpara_a
    `open and close the school year in order`
    @ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_1__para_6__subpara_b
    `see to the school's services`
    @ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_1__para_6__subpara_c
    `run the pupils' library`
    @ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_1__para_6__subpara_d
    `keep the educational records`
    @ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_1__para_6__subpara_e
    `keep the school's records`
    @ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_1__para_6__subpara_f
    `enrich equipment and facilities`
    @ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_1__para_6__subpara_g
    `see to the school's finances`
    @ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_1__para_6__subpara_h
    `enforce safety and accident instructions`
    @ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_1__para_6__subpara_i
    `enforce civil-defence procedure with the competent bodies`
    @ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_1__para_6__subpara_j
    `hand the school over when principals change`
    @ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_1__para_7__subpara_a
    `follow the work in study, education and administration and ensure it is done`
    @ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_1__para_7__subpara_b akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_1__para_7__subpara_b/p2
    `set the order of written work and exams and check teachers' reports on them`
    @ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_1__para_8
    `consult and involve the staff in planning and execution`
    @ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_1__para_9
    `set the deputy's areas with the deputy, the supervisor informed`
    @ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_1__para_12 akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_1__para_12__subpara_a akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_1__para_12__subpara_b akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_1__para_12__subpara_c
    `divide the roles among the teachers after consulting the supervisor and the teachers`
    @ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_1__para_13 akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_1__para_13__subpara_a
    `register pupils under the registration regulations`
    @ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_1__para_13__subpara_b
    `follow attendance and treat irregular attendance`
    @ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_1__para_13__subpara_c
    `handle pupils needing special frameworks`
    @ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_1__para_14
    `keep ties with parents and public bodies, without party or sectarian ties`
    @ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_1__para_15__subpara_a
    `guide the teachers, especially new ones`
    @ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_1__para_15__subpara_c
    `accompany the supervisor's class visits, as a rule`
    @ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_1__para_16
    `run and chair the pedagogical council and carry out its decisions`
    @ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_1__para_19
    `take part in building and development planning`

GIVEN d IS A `primary principal's duty`
GIVETH A DEONTIC `7.6 party` `7.6 action`
DECIDE `a primary principal's duty` d IS
    PARTY `a takanon party` `the school principal`
    MUST  `perform a primary duty` x PROVIDED x EQUALS d
    WITHIN 12
    LEST  BREACH BY `a takanon party` `the school principal` BECAUSE "section 7.6.3.1: the duties of a primary-school principal"

@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_1__para_3__subpara_d
GIVEN `released for special reasons` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `primary principal's minimum lessons` `released for special reasons` IS
    `principal's minimum teaching hours` `a school` `released for special reasons`

@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_1__para_9
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `delegating to the deputy relieves the principal` IS FALSE

-- (10)-(11): in the principal's absence the deputy he appointed stands in,
-- unless the supervisor decides otherwise; with no deputy, a teacher the
-- principal names each year with the supervisor's approval.
DECLARE `stand-in for an absent principal` IS ONE OF
    `the deputy the principal appointed`
    `whoever the supervisor decides`
    `the teacher named for the year`

@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_1__para_10 akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_1__para_11
GIVEN `has a deputy` IS A BOOLEAN, `the supervisor decided otherwise` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `stand-in for an absent principal`
DECIDE `who stands in for an absent primary principal` `has a deputy` `the supervisor decided otherwise` IS
    IF `the supervisor decided otherwise` THEN `whoever the supervisor decides`
    ELSE IF `has a deputy` THEN `the deputy the principal appointed`
         ELSE `the teacher named for the year`

-- A special task for a teacher who also works in another school needs that
-- school's principal's consent first.
@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_1__para_12__subpara_c/p2 akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_1__para_12__subpara_c/p3
GIVETH A DEONTIC `7.6 party` `7.6 action`
DECIDE `a task for a teacher of another school` IS
    PARTY `a takanon party` `the school principal`
    MUST  `obtain the other principal's consent`
    WITHIN 1
    HENCE (PARTY `a takanon party` `the school principal` MAY `assign a special task to a teacher of another school`)
    LEST  (PARTY `a takanon party` `the school principal`
           SHANT `assign a special task to a teacher of another school`
           LEST BREACH BY `a takanon party` `the school principal` BECAUSE "section 7.6.3.1(12)(c): the other principal consents first")

@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_1__para_12__subpara_c/p4
GIVETH A Party
DECIDE `who places new teachers in the school` IS `the supervisor`

@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_1__para_15__subpara_b
GIVETH A DEONTIC `7.6 party` `7.6 action`
DECIDE `no remarks before pupils or parents` IS
    PARTY `a takanon party` `the school principal`
    SHANT `remark to a teacher before pupils or parents`
    WITHIN 12
    LEST  BREACH BY `a takanon party` `the school principal` BECAUSE "section 7.6.3.1(15)(b): no remarks to teachers before pupils or parents"

-- Guests, the ministry's people included, visit with the principal's
-- knowledge; the principal does not upset his plans for them, as far as possible.
@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_1__para_17
GIVEN `the principal knows of the visit` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a guest may visit` `the principal knows of the visit` IF
    `the principal knows of the visit`

@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_1__para_18
GIVETH A DEONTIC `7.6 party` `7.6 action`
DECIDE `the yearly report on the school` IS
    PARTY `a takanon party` `the school principal`
    MUST  `report on the state of the school`
    WITHIN 12
    LEST  BREACH BY `a takanon party` `the school principal` BECAUSE "section 7.6.3.1(18): a report once a year on the school's state"

-- No letter of recommendation to a teacher or substitute; one may go
-- straight to the supervisor.
@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_1__para_20
GIVETH A DEONTIC `7.6 party` `7.6 action`
DECIDE `no letter of recommendation to a teacher` IS
    PARTY `a takanon party` `the school principal`
    SHANT `hand a teacher a letter of recommendation`
    WITHIN 12
    LEST  BREACH BY `a takanon party` `the school principal` BECAUSE "section 7.6.3.1(20): a recommendation goes to the supervisor, never to the teacher"

-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_1/p1 Heading of the source list (אסמכתא).
-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_1/p2 Source: a special director-general's circular.
-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_1/p3 Source: a director-general's circular.

§§§ `7.6.3.2 מנהל בית ספר על יסודי`

DECLARE `post-primary principal's duty` IS ONE OF
    @ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_2__para_1__subpara_a
    `shape the school's character with its teachers`
    @ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_2__para_1__subpara_b
    `deepen pedagogical thought and propose improvements`
    @ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_2__para_1__subpara_c
    `answer for studies, activities, property and finances, and sign the school's documents`
    @ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_2__para_2
    `run and supervise the approved curricula`
    @ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_2__para_3
    `prepare the timetable within the hours the owners allot`
    @ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_2__para_4
    `represent the school`
    @ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_2__para_5__subpara_a
    `set the school's general arrangements`
    @ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_2__para_5__subpara_b
    `consult the pedagogical council on matters of principle`
    @ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_2__para_6
    `set admission and class composition`
    @ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_2__para_7
    `propose equipment and facilities to the owners`
    @ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_2__para_8__subpara_a
    `initiate social-educational activities with the owners`
    @ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_2__para_8__subpara_b akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_2__para_8__subpara_b__cls_1
    `foster national, civic and community education, and religious education in a state-religious school `
    @ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_2__para_8__subpara_b__cls_2
    `coordinate care for the individual pupil `
    @ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_2__para_8__subpara_b__cls_3
    `foster school life, and prayer and observance in a state-religious school `
    @ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_2__para_9
    `answer the ministry's and owners' invitations`
    @ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_2__para_10__subpara_a akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_2__para_10__subpara_b
    `attend the owners' and the local education authority's meetings on the school`
    @ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_2__para_11
    `prepare budget data and carry out the budget`
    @ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_2__para_12__subpara_a
    `report on the year and submit next year's plans`
    @ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_2__para_12__subpara_b
    `plan the pedagogical work`
    @ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_2__para_13
    `convene and chair the pedagogical council`
    @ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_2__para_14
    `appoint the staff committees and approve their decisions`
    @ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_2__para_15__subpara_a akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_2__para_15__subpara_b
    `propose to the owners the appointment or dismissal of the deputy and teachers`
    @ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_2__para_16__subpara_a
    `set the deputies' and assistants' areas, keeping the responsibility`
    @ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_2__para_17
    `propose to the owners the hiring or dismissal of administrative and maintenance staff `
    @ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_2__para_18__subpara_a
    `name the class educators each year`
    @ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_2__para_18__subpara_b
    `name the subject coordinators and other role holders within the establishment`
    @ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_2__para_19__subpara_a akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_2__para_19__subpara_b
    `set each teacher's subjects and classes`
    @ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_2__para_21
    `arrange cover for absent teachers`
    @ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_2__para_22
    `set the order of written work and exams `
    @ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_2__para_24
    `set meetings with parents`
    @ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_2__para_25
    `keep the confidential pupil card`
    @ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_2__para_26
    `answer for the medical service, safety and civil defence`
    @ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_2__para_28 akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_2__para_28/p2
    `in a religious school, organise prayer and observance`

GIVEN d IS A `post-primary principal's duty`
GIVETH A DEONTIC `7.6 party` `7.6 action`
DECIDE `a post-primary principal's duty` d IS
    PARTY `a takanon party` `the school principal`
    MUST  `perform a post-primary duty` x PROVIDED x EQUALS d
    WITHIN 12
    LEST  BREACH BY `a takanon party` `the school principal` BECAUSE "section 7.6.3.2: the duties of a post-primary principal"

@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_2__para_16__subpara_b
GIVEN `has a deputy appointed for this` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A STRING
DECIDE `who stands in for an absent post-primary principal` `has a deputy appointed for this` IS
    IF `has a deputy appointed for this`
    THEN "the deputy the principal appointed with the owners' agreement"
    ELSE "whoever the principal appointed to stand in"

@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_2__para_19__subpara_c
GIVEN `released for special reasons` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `post-primary principal's minimum teaching hours` `released for special reasons` IS
    `principal's minimum teaching hours` `a school` `released for special reasons`

-- (20): visits to the lessons of teachers without tenure at least once a
-- trimester (a school year has three: four school months each); a daily
-- visit is desirable, not required; a talk on the teacher's request.
@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_2__para_20__subpara_a
GIVETH A DEONTIC `7.6 party` `7.6 action`
DECIDE `a visit each trimester` IS
    PARTY `a takanon party` `the school principal`
    MUST  `visit the lessons of teachers without tenure`
    WITHIN 4
    LEST  BREACH BY `a takanon party` `the school principal` BECAUSE "section 7.6.3.2(20)(a): visits at least once a trimester"

@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_2__para_20__subpara_b
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a daily visit is required` IS FALSE

@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_2__para_20__subpara_c
GIVEN `the teacher asked` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC `7.6 party` `7.6 action`
DECIDE `a talk about the visit` `the teacher asked` IS
    IF `the teacher asked`
    THEN PARTY `a takanon party` `the school principal`
         MUST  `talk with the teacher about the visit`
         WITHIN 1
         LEST  BREACH BY `a takanon party` `the school principal` BECAUSE "section 7.6.3.2(20)(c): a talk about the visit, on the teacher's request"
    ELSE FULFILLED

@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_2__para_23
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the principal may demand the data behind a grade` IS TRUE

@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_2__para_27__subpara_a
GIVEN `the owners allowed it in writing` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC `7.6 party` `7.6 action`
DECIDE `no additional work in school hours` `the owners allowed it in writing` IS
    IF `the owners allowed it in writing`
    THEN FULFILLED
    ELSE PARTY `a takanon party` `the school principal`
         SHANT `take additional work in school hours`
         WITHIN 12
         LEST  BREACH BY `a takanon party` `the school principal` BECAUSE "section 7.6.3.2(27)(a): no additional work in school hours without the owners' written permission"

@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_2__para_27__subpara_b
GIVEN `the owners and the supervision approved` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC `7.6 party` `7.6 action`
DECIDE `no paid role besides management` `the owners and the supervision approved` IS
    IF `the owners and the supervision approved`
    THEN FULFILLED
    ELSE PARTY `a takanon party` `the school principal`
         SHANT `take a paid role in the school`
         WITHIN 12
         LEST  BREACH BY `a takanon party` `the school principal` BECAUSE "section 7.6.3.2(27)(b): no paid role besides management without the owners' and the supervision's approval"

-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_2/p1 Heading of the source list (אסמכתא).
-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_3_2/p2 Source: a special director-general's circular.

§§ `7.6.4 תקופת ניסיון וקביעות`

@desc A principal or coordinator in probation, one school year at a time.
DECLARE `probation year` HAS
    `started before 1 January`         IS A BOOLEAN @desc began managing in this school year before 1 January
    `worked continuously to the year's end` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the school year ended`            IS A BOOLEAN
    `as acting principal just before appointment` IS A BOOLEAN
    `as a school coordinator`          IS A BOOLEAN @desc the year was served as a school coordinator (מרכז), not as principal

@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_4__para_1
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `probation years` IS 3

@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_4__para_1 akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_4__para_2
GIVEN y IS A `probation year`, `toward a principal's probation` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the year counts toward probation` y `toward a principal's probation` IF
        y's `the school year ended`
    AND (y's `started before 1 January` AND y's `worked continuously to the year's end`)
    AND NOT (`toward a principal's probation` AND y's `as a school coordinator`)

-- (3): lists to the general supervisors by 1 October (school month 2) and
-- kept current; (4): also to the local education authority.
@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_4__para_3 akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_4__para_4
GIVETH A DEONTIC `7.6 party` `7.6 action`
DECIDE `the probation lists` IS
    (PARTY `the district office`
     MUST  `deliver the probation lists`
     WITHIN 1
     LEST  BREACH BY `the district office` BECAUSE "section 7.6.4.3: the lists reach the general supervisors by 1 October")
    RAND
    (PARTY `the district office`
     MUST  `forward the probation list to the local authority`
     WITHIN 1
     LEST  BREACH BY `the district office` BECAUSE "section 7.6.4.4: the list goes to the local education authority")

@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_4__para_5
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the supervisor's attendance at the school's meetings is required` IS FALSE

@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_4__para_6
GIVETH A DEONTIC `7.6 party` `7.6 action`
DECIDE `a yearly evaluation in probation` IS
    PARTY `a takanon party` `the supervisor`
    MUST  `submit a detailed evaluation`
    WITHIN 12
    LEST  BREACH BY `a takanon party` `the supervisor` BECAUSE "section 7.6.4.6: a detailed evaluation each probation year"

-- (7): a professional supervisor's evaluation, if sent, is taken into
-- account; (12): the local authority's is taken into account only if it
-- reaches the district manager by 1 March (school month 7).
@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_4__para_7 akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_4__para_12
GIVEN `from a professional supervisor` IS A BOOLEAN, `from the local authority` IS A BOOLEAN, `school month received` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the evaluation is taken into account` `from a professional supervisor` `from the local authority` `school month received` IF
    `from a professional supervisor`
    OR (`from the local authority` AND `school month received` LESS THAN `month number` March)

@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_4__para_8 akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_4__para_9
GIVEN `asked to come earlier` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC `7.6 party` `7.6 action`
DECIDE `the district manager's visit` `asked to come earlier` IS
    IF `asked to come earlier`
    THEN PARTY `a takanon party` `the district manager` MUST `bring the visit forward` WITHIN 1
    ELSE PARTY `a takanon party` `the district manager`
         MUST  `visit and evaluate in writing`
         WITHIN 12
         LEST  BREACH BY `a takanon party` `the district manager` BECAUSE "section 7.6.4.8: a visit toward the end of probation, evaluated in writing"

-- (10)-(11): evaluations of state-religious principals also go to the head
-- of religious education; the district manager's covers administration only.
DECLARE `evaluation scope` IS ONE OF `pedagogical and administrative`, `administrative only`

@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_4__para_10 akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_4__para_11
GIVEN `state-religious` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH AN `evaluation scope`
DECIDE `the district manager's evaluation covers` `state-religious` IS
    IF `state-religious` THEN `administrative only` ELSE `pedagogical and administrative`

-- (13): below average, or deficiencies: the principal is told in writing
-- (for a state-religious pedagogical evaluation only with the religious
-- education head's consent), a copy to the senior division.
@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_4__para_13
GIVEN `below average or deficient` IS A BOOLEAN, `state-religious pedagogical` IS A BOOLEAN, `religious head consents` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC `7.6 party` `7.6 action`
DECIDE `deficiencies are notified` `below average or deficient` `state-religious pedagogical` `religious head consents` IS
    IF `below average or deficient` AND ((NOT `state-religious pedagogical`) OR `religious head consents`)
    THEN PARTY `a takanon party` `the district manager`
         MUST  `notify deficiencies in writing`
         WITHIN 1
         LEST  BREACH BY `a takanon party` `the district manager` BECAUSE "section 7.6.4.13: deficiencies are notified in writing"
    ELSE FULFILLED

-- (14)-(15): a termination proposal, or a tenure proposal where all three
-- evaluations are positive at the end of the second trimester of the last
-- year, goes to the senior division by 1 May (school month 9); (16) a
-- consultation where the evaluations differ; (17) the director-general decides.
DECLARE `evaluations` IS ONE OF
    `sufficient reasons to end the employment`
    `all three positive`
    `the evaluations differ`

@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_4__para_14 akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_4__para_15 akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_4__para_16
GIVEN e IS AN `evaluations`
GIVETH A DEONTIC `7.6 party` `7.6 action`
DECIDE `the end of probation` e IS
    CONSIDER e
    WHEN `sufficient reasons to end the employment` THEN
        PARTY `a takanon party` `the district manager`
        MUST  `forward a termination proposal`
        WITHIN `month number` April
        LEST  BREACH BY `a takanon party` `the district manager` BECAUSE "section 7.6.4.14: the termination proposal goes at once, by 1 May"
    WHEN `all three positive` THEN
        PARTY `a takanon party` `the district manager`
        MUST  `forward a tenure proposal`
        WITHIN `month number` April
        LEST  BREACH BY `a takanon party` `the district manager` BECAUSE "section 7.6.4.15: the tenure proposal goes by 1 May"
    WHEN `the evaluations differ` THEN
        PARTY `a takanon party` `the district manager`
        MUST  `convene a consultation on differing evaluations`
        WITHIN 1

@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_4__para_17
GIVETH A Party
DECIDE `who grants tenure or dismisses from management` IS `the director-general`

-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_4/p1 Heading of the source list (אסמכתא).
-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_4/p2 Source: a circular of the primary-education administration.

§§ `7.6.6 גמולים`

§§§ `7.6.6.1 גמול ניהול`

-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_6_1/p1 Amendment note ("amended 13.08.03").

@desc A school whose principal's management allowance section 7.6.6.1 sets.
DECLARE `managed school` HAS
    `classes in all`             IS A NUMBER @desc m: the total number of classes
    `post-primary classes`       IS A NUMBER @desc x: classes of grade 7 and above in a primary school
    `special-education classes`  IS A NUMBER @desc y: special-education classes
    `table rate for m classes`   IS A NUMBER @desc p(m): the table's rate, in percent, as if every class were a regular primary class; the table (in force from 1.1.98) is not in the text, so an input

-- (1): a percentage of the personal combined salary, by the table; (2) by
-- the institution's grade and classes, not by the position fraction.
@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_6_1__para_3 akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_6_1__para_3__subpara_a akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_6_1__para_3__subpara_b akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_6_1__para_3__subpara_c akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_6_1__para_3__subpara_d
GIVEN s IS A `managed school`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `management allowance rate` s IS
    BRANCH IF s's `post-primary classes` GREATER THAN 0 AND s's `special-education classes` GREATER THAN 0
           THEN s's `table rate for m classes` PLUS 0.7 TIMES (s's `post-primary classes` PLUS s's `special-education classes`) PLUS 0.9
           IF s's `post-primary classes` GREATER THAN 0
           THEN s's `table rate for m classes` PLUS 0.7 TIMES s's `post-primary classes` PLUS 0.3
           IF s's `special-education classes` GREATER THAN 0
           THEN s's `table rate for m classes` PLUS 0.7 TIMES s's `special-education classes` PLUS 0.6
           OTHERWISE s's `table rate for m classes`

-- The combined formula (d) is the sum of (b) and (c): 0.3 + 0.6 = 0.9.
#ASSERT 0.3 PLUS 0.6 EQUALS 0.9

@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_6_1__para_1 akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_6_1__para_2 akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_6_1__para_1__subpara_a
GIVEN s IS A `managed school`, `personal combined salary` IS A NUMBER, `position fraction` IS A NUMBER,
      `years in management` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `management allowance` s `personal combined salary` `position fraction` `years in management` IS
    LET amount MEANS `management allowance rate` s DIVIDED BY 100 TIMES `personal combined salary`
    IN amount PLUS `management seniority addition` amount `years in management`

-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_6_1__para_1/p2 Effective date of the table (from 1.1.98); the file encodes the rule in force and carries no dates.

-- Clarification: a deputy or principal who receives the allowance as a
-- component of pay elsewhere (a study year, a pension) and lawfully works
-- part-time is not paid it again for that part-time work.
@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_6_1__para_2/p2
GIVEN `receives the allowance as a component elsewhere` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `paid a management allowance for part-time work` `receives the allowance as a component elsewhere` IF
    NOT `receives the allowance as a component elsewhere`

-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_6_1__para_4 A pointer to section 9.10 (the technicians' division principal), encoded there.
-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_6_1__para_5 A pointer to section 14.10.6 (adult education), encoded there.
-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_6_1__para_6 A pointer to section 7.3.6.1 for counting classes in a maritime or agricultural school, encoded there.
-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_6_1__para_6/p2 The section the pointer names (7.3.6.1, subsection 1(a)).

@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_6_1__para_7
GIVEN `post-primary rate for the same number of classes` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `working-youth school principal's rate` `post-primary rate for the same number of classes` IS
    0.8 TIMES `post-primary rate for the same number of classes`

-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_6_1__para_8 A pointer to section 11.6.5 (teacher-training institutions), encoded there.

-- (9)(a): a principal (not a coordinator) of at least 8 years whose classes
-- fell keeps the allowance for the average of the last 4 years before the
-- fall, rounded to the nearest whole number. F-7.6-d: four whole numbers
-- can average to a half. Reading adopted: a half rounds up.
@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_6_1__para_9 akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_6_1__para_9__subpara_a akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_6_1__para_9__subpara_a/p2
GIVEN `classes in the last four years` IS A LIST OF NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `average classes kept` `classes in the last four years` IS
    FLOOR (sum `classes in the last four years` DIVIDED BY 4 PLUS 0.5)

`four class counts can average to exactly a half` MEANS
    LET avg MEANS sum (LIST 10, 11, 10, 11) DIVIDED BY 4
    IN avg MINUS FLOOR avg EQUALS 0.5
#ASSERT `four class counts can average to exactly a half`

@desc A principal whose classes fell, or who left management, as section 7.6.6.1(9) asks.
DECLARE `principal's history` HAS
    `years as principal`              IS A NUMBER
    `a coordinator`                   IS A BOOLEAN
    `same owners`                     IS A BOOLEAN @desc still working for the same owners (the note to (9)(a))
    `classes in the last four years`  IS A LIST OF NUMBER
    `classes now`                     IS A NUMBER
    `left management but teaches`     IS A BOOLEAN @desc stopped being a principal but still teaches, not in supervision or guidance
    `left management of his own will` IS A BOOLEAN
    `teaching position fraction`      IS A NUMBER

@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_6_1__para_9__subpara_a/p5
GIVEN h IS A `principal's history`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may keep the allowance for past classes` h IF
    h's `years as principal` AT LEAST 8 AND (NOT h's `a coordinator`) AND h's `same owners`

@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_6_1__para_9__subpara_a/p3
GIVEN h IS A `principal's history`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `classes the allowance is paid for` h IS
    IF `may keep the allowance for past classes` h
    THEN max (h's `classes now`) (`average classes kept` (h's `classes in the last four years`))
    ELSE h's `classes now`

-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_6_1__para_9__subpara_a/p4 Effective date of (9)(a) (from 1.9.1976); the file encodes the rule in force and carries no dates.

-- (9)(b)(1): one who left management but teaches is treated the same; who
-- left of his own will carries the allowance pro rata to his teaching.
@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_6_1__para_9__subpara_b__cls_1 akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_6_1__para_9__subpara_b__cls_1/p2
GIVEN h IS A `principal's history`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `share of the allowance carried after leaving management` h IS
    IF NOT (h's `left management but teaches` AND `may keep the allowance for past classes` h)
    THEN 0
    ELSE IF h's `left management of his own will`
         THEN h's `teaching position fraction`
         ELSE 1

-- (9)(b)(2): moving to a school of the same level with fewer classes does
-- not lower the allowance.
@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_6_1__para_9__subpara_b__cls_2
GIVEN h IS A `principal's history`, `previous rate` IS A NUMBER, `new school's rate` IS A NUMBER, `same level` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `rate after moving schools` h `previous rate` `new school's rate` `same level` IS
    IF `same level` AND `may keep the allowance for past classes` h
    THEN max `previous rate` `new school's rate`
    ELSE `new school's rate`

-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_6_1__para_9__subpara_b__cls_2/p2 Effective date of (9)(b)(2) (from 1.9.1977); the file encodes the rule in force and carries no dates.

-- (9)(c): a permanent primary principal whose classes fell when grades 7-8
-- moved to a middle school keeps the earlier rate.
@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_6_1__para_9__subpara_c akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_6_1__para_9__subpara_c/p2
GIVEN `permanent` IS A BOOLEAN, `fell by the 7-8 transfer` IS A BOOLEAN, `earlier rate` IS A NUMBER, `rate now` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `rate after the 7-8 transfer` `permanent` `fell by the 7-8 transfer` `earlier rate` `rate now` IS
    IF `permanent` AND `fell by the 7-8 transfer`
    THEN max `earlier rate` `rate now`
    ELSE `rate now`

-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_6_1__para_10 A pointer to section 7.3.6.1 for principals aged 50 or more at the reform, encoded there.
-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_6_1/p2 Heading of the source list (אסמכתא).
-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_6_1/p3 Source: a circular and the collective agreement of 10.3.83.
-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_6_1/p4 Source: collective agreement of 11.5.93.
-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_6_1/p5 Source: collective agreement of 8.9.98.
-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_6_1/p6 Source: collective agreement of 22.2.79 and a circular.
-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_6_1/p7 Source: annex C of the special collective agreement.
-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_6_1/p8 Source: a director-general's circular.
-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_6_1/p9 Source: legal-bureau and conditions-of-service clarifications and a parity committee decision.
-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_6_1/p10 Source: a director-general's circular.
-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_6_1/p11 Source: a circular and a parity committee decision of 28.10.71.

§§§ `7.6.6.2 גמול טלפונים`

-- An amount in place of 150 calls, pro rata to the position and the period
-- worked, for at most one position.
@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_6_2__para_1 akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_6_2__para_1/p2
GIVEN `full-position amount` IS A NUMBER @desc the amount in place of the 150 calls; set outside this section, an input
      `position fraction` IS A NUMBER, `share of the period worked` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `principal's telephone amount` `full-position amount` `position fraction` `share of the period worked` IS
    `full-position amount` TIMES min `position fraction` 1 TIMES `share of the period worked`

@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_6_2__para_2
GIVEN `primary education` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A Party
DECIDE `where the telephone request goes` `primary education` IS
    IF `primary education` THEN `the district manager` ELSE `the local authority or owning body`

-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_6_2/p1 Heading of the source list (אסמכתא).
-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_6_2/p2 Source: a special director-general's circular.
-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_6_2/p3 Source: a director-general's circular.
-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_6_2/p4 Source: an accountant-general's circular.

§§§ `7.6.6.3 הוצאות נסיעה`

-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_6_3/p1 Amendment note ("amended 12.1.04").

DECLARE `travel reimbursement` IS ONE OF
    `as a private-car owner` HAS `car grade` IS A NUMBER @desc grade 3, 4 or 5, set by the joint committee of the ministry and the teachers' organisations
    `actual expenses on reports`

@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_6_3__para_1 akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_6_3__para_1/p2 akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_6_3__para_2
GIVEN `car registered to the principal or spouse` IS A BOOLEAN, `valid licence` IS A BOOLEAN, `grade set by the joint committee` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `travel reimbursement`
DECIDE `principal's travel reimbursement` `car registered to the principal or spouse` `valid licence` `grade set by the joint committee` IS
    IF `car registered to the principal or spouse` AND `valid licence` AND `grade set by the joint committee` AT LEAST 3 AND `grade set by the joint committee` AT MOST 5
    THEN `as a private-car owner` `grade set by the joint committee`
    ELSE `actual expenses on reports`

@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_6_3__para_3
GIVEN `months worked in the summer recess` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `months of travel expenses` `months worked in the summer recess` IS
    IF `months worked in the summer recess` AT LEAST 1 THEN 11 ELSE 10

-- The 10 months where no summer work is required is the file's reading of
-- what 7.6.6.3(3) departs from, which the text does not state; the rule it
-- does state is the 11.

-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_6_3/p2 Heading of the source list (אסמכתא).
-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_6_3/p3 Source: the Etzioni committee and a Treasury letter.
-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_6_3/p4 Source: a supreme parity committee summary of 10.12.91.

§§ `7.6.8 מילוי מקום`

-- (1): no paid substitute for an absence of up to 6 days; for longer, the
-- district manager MAY release the staff teacher who stands in from as many
-- teaching hours as the principal's recognised management hours.
@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_8__para_1
GIVEN `days absent` IS A NUMBER, `recognised management hours` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `teaching hours the stand-in may be released from` `days absent` `recognised management hours` IS
    IF `days absent` AT MOST 6 THEN 0 ELSE `recognised management hours`

@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_8__para_2
GIVEN `hours released` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `hours for a substitute teacher` `hours released` IS `hours released`

-- (3): a stand-in of more than 30 days has the principal's allowance from
-- the 31st day.
@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_8__para_3
GIVEN `days as stand-in` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `days the stand-in is paid the management allowance` `days as stand-in` IS
    IF `days as stand-in` GREATER THAN 30 THEN `days as stand-in` MINUS 30 ELSE 0

-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_8__para_3/p2 A pointer to section 1.30, encoded there.
-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_8/p1 Heading of the source list (אסמכתא).
-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_8/p2 Source: a special director-general's circular.

§§ `7.6.9 היעדרות`

-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_9/p3 Effective date of 7.6.9.1 (from 1.9.90); the rule itself is encoded with section 7.6.1.4 above.
-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_9/p4 Heading ("השתתפות בהשתלמויות, בכנסים ובימי עיון").

@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_9/p5
GIVETH A DEONTIC `7.6 party` `7.6 action`
DECIDE `seminars for principals are planned outside school hours` IS
    PARTY `the seminar organisers`
    MUST  `plan the seminars for afternoons or vacations`
    WITHIN 1

@desc A seminar, conference or study day held in working hours.
DECLARE `working-hours seminar` HAS
    `needs the principal himself`  IS A BOOLEAN @desc case 1: the subject needs the principal and not a teacher of the staff
    `national or several districts` IS A BOOLEAN @desc case 2
    `a stand-in is arranged`        IS A BOOLEAN @desc item 3: the deputy, or a teacher, stands in that day
    `a counted national seminar`    IS A BOOLEAN @desc a national seminar of the kinds (d) excludes from the count

-- F-7.6-e: (b) lists three items as "these cases"; the third is a duty
-- rather than a case. Reading adopted: case 1 or case 2, and item 3 always.
@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_9/p6 akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_9/p7 akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_9/p8 akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_9/p9
GIVEN s IS A `working-hours seminar`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the principal may attend in working hours` s IF
    (s's `needs the principal himself` OR s's `national or several districts`) AND s's `a stand-in is arranged`

GIVEN s IS A `working-hours seminar`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the principal may attend, all three items required` s IF
    s's `needs the principal himself` AND s's `national or several districts` AND s's `a stand-in is arranged`

`a district seminar the principal must attend in person` MEANS
    `working-hours seminar` WITH
        `needs the principal himself`   IS TRUE
        `national or several districts` IS FALSE
        `a stand-in is arranged`        IS TRUE
        `a counted national seminar`    IS FALSE

`the readings of 7.6.9.2(b) differ for a one-district seminar` MEANS
    NOT (`the principal may attend in working hours` `a district seminar the principal must attend in person`
         EQUALS `the principal may attend, all three items required` `a district seminar the principal must attend in person`)
#ASSERT `the readings of 7.6.9.2(b) differ for a one-district seminar`

-- (c)-(d): at most two days a month, national seminars of the kinds named
-- not counted; exceptions are for the pedagogical administration's head.
@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_9/p10 akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_9/p11
GIVEN `exception approved by the pedagogical administration's head` IS A BOOLEAN,
      seminars IS A LIST OF `working-hours seminar`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `within the monthly limit` `exception approved by the pedagogical administration's head` seminars IF
    count (filter (GIVEN s YIELD NOT s's `a counted national seminar`) seminars) AT MOST 2
    OR `exception approved by the pedagogical administration's head`

-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_9/p12 Effective date of the seminar rules (from תשנ"ז); the file encodes them as in force and carries no dates.
-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_9/p13 Heading of the source list (אסמכתא).
-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_9/p14 Source: a special director-general's circular.
-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_9/p15 Source: director-general's circulars.

§§ `7.6.10 ותק בניהול`

-- (1): 2.4% a year for 16 years from the second year, added to the
-- allowance amount (the rate times the personal combined salary and the
-- 1994 teaching supplement) and not computed on the salary itself.
@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_10__para_1 akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_10__para_1/p2
GIVEN `allowance amount` IS A NUMBER, `years in management` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `management seniority addition` `allowance amount` `years in management` IS
    `allowance amount` TIMES 0.024 TIMES min (max 0 (`years in management` MINUS 1)) 16

-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_10__para_1/p3 Heading of an auxiliary table for the addition; the table is not in the text, and the rule above is the paragraph's own.

-- (2): years managing a working-youth school count for a primary
-- principal's seniority if the teacher was certified and held at least half
-- a position; they do not count for a primary deputy's seniority.
@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_10__para_2
GIVEN `certified at the time` IS A BOOLEAN, `position fraction there` IS A NUMBER, `for a deputy's seniority` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `working-youth management counts` `certified at the time` `position fraction there` `for a deputy's seniority` IF
    `certified at the time` AND `position fraction there` AT LEAST 0.5 AND NOT `for a deputy's seniority`

-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_10__para_2/p2 Effective date of (2) (from 1.9.1967); the file encodes the rule in force and carries no dates.

DECLARE `period away from managing a school` IS ONE OF
    `a sabbatical with completed duties and the fund's certificate`
    `a sabbatical without them`
    `managing abroad, the teaching there recognised`
    `managing abroad, not recognised`
    `as a supervisor or guide, then back to managing`
    `heading a local authority's education department, as a certified teacher`

@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_10__para_3 akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_10__para_4 akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_10__para_5 akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_10__para_6
GIVEN p IS A `period away from managing a school`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `counts as management seniority` p IF
    CONSIDER p
    WHEN `a sabbatical without them`        THEN FALSE
    WHEN `managing abroad, not recognised`  THEN FALSE
    OTHERWISE TRUE

-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_10__para_3/p2 Effective date of (3) (from 1.9.88); the file encodes the rule in force and carries no dates.

-- (7): a new principal carries 50% of his seniority as deputy, for the
-- addition only; half a year rounds to a whole year.
@ref akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_10__para_7
GIVEN `years as deputy` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `management seniority carried from the deputyship` `years as deputy` IS
    FLOOR (0.5 TIMES `years as deputy` PLUS 0.5)

-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_10__para_7/p2 Effective date of (7) (from 1.9.1984); the file encodes the rule in force and carries no dates.
-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_10/p1 Heading of the source list (אסמכתא).
-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_10/p2 Source: collective agreements of 11.5.93 and 19.9.94.
-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_10/p3 Source: circulars and collective agreements.
-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_10/p4 Source: collective agreement of 23.12.90.
-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_10/p5 Source: a director-general's circular.
-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_10/p6 Source: a director-general's circular.
-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_10/p7 Source: an abbreviation of a ministry unit.
-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_10/p8 Source: a teaching-personnel division circular.
-- akn:chp_7__sec_7_6__ssec_7_6_10/p9 Source: a director-general's circular.

-- Examples. Rates and salaries are placeholders: the allowance table is
-- not part of the text.
`a primary school with grades 7-8 and special classes` MEANS
    `managed school` WITH
        `classes in all`            IS 20
        `post-primary classes`      IS 4
        `special-education classes` IS 2
        `table rate for m classes`  IS 10

#ASSERT `management allowance rate` `a primary school with grades 7-8 and special classes` EQUALS 15.1
#ASSERT `management seniority addition` 1000 1 EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `management seniority addition` 1000 30 EQUALS 384
#ASSERT `management allowance` `a primary school with grades 7-8 and special classes` 10000 0.5 2 EQUALS 1546.24
#ASSERT `average classes kept` (LIST 10, 11, 10, 11) EQUALS 11
#ASSERT `management seniority carried from the deputyship` 5 EQUALS 3
#ASSERT `days the stand-in is paid the management allowance` 45 EQUALS 15
#ASSERT `the advisory committee for` `primary, state` EQUALS `primary state committee`
#ASSERT `the committee resolves in favour` 2 2 TRUE

#TRACE `the end of probation` `all three positive` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `a takanon party` `the district manager` DOES `forward a tenure proposal` AT 7
#TRACE `the end of probation` `all three positive` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `a takanon party` `the district manager` DOES `forward a tenure proposal` AT 11
#TRACE `the interview invitation` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the district personnel head` DOES `invite to an interview` 1 AT 0
#TRACE `no letter of recommendation to a teacher` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `a takanon party` `the school principal` DOES `hand a teacher a letter of recommendation` AT 3
